ejected if they contain sensitive keywords in descriptions.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"EndLine":"145","Path":"\"/Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/utils/clean_items.py\"","StartLine":"100"}}]}
